        </style><div xmlns="" class="content_block"><h2 class="auth__title">Справочник рабочих и выходных дней в 2026 году</h2><div class="doc-snippet"><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfas6tkinl/" data-dfa="dfas6tkinl"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr2/"></a>В справочнике –&nbsp;норма&nbsp;рабочих и выходных дней в 2026 году.&nbsp; </div><div id="documentBody" class="content-common"><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/tit1/" data-role="toc-anchor" class="toc-anchor"></a><h2 class="main__title-section title toc" toc-anchor="tit1"><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr7/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfasth5eky/" data-dfa="dfasth5eky"></a>ЯНВАРЬ</h2><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfas2by9rl/" data-dfa="dfas2by9rl"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr8/"></a><img alt="1235х354" hideborder="true" class="inimg" lnktype="img" id="-41915979" sourceId="1" fullSizeImageId="-41915978" width="610" height="172.86103542234332" src="https://1gb.uz/system/content/image/297/1/-41915979/"></p><div><div class="table-wide scroller-wrapper"><div class="scroller table-scroller"><div class="scroller__container"><table height="253" width="100.00%"><caption></caption><tbody><tr><td class="bdAll" style="width: 50.08%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr10/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfas6huhs1/" data-dfa="dfas6huhs1"></a><strong>Для пятидневной рабочей недели:</strong></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr11/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfastxmgqb/" data-dfa="dfastxmgqb"></a>Рабочих дней&nbsp;— 20</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr12/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfasgo1sdk/" data-dfa="dfasgo1sdk"></a>Выходных&nbsp;— 11</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr13/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfasgipqsc/" data-dfa="dfasgipqsc"></a>Норма рабочего времени:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr14/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfasoenyse/" data-dfa="dfasoenyse"></a>При 40-часовой рабочей недели&nbsp;— 160 ч.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr15/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfaspbzo0g/" data-dfa="dfaspbzo0g"></a>При 36-часовой рабочей недели&nbsp;— 144&nbsp;ч.</p></td><td class="bdTopbdBottombdRight" style="width: 49.78%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr16/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfas7ogki8/" data-dfa="dfas7ogki8"></a><strong>Для шестидневной рабочей недели:</strong></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr17/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfas91waqq/" data-dfa="dfas91waqq"></a>Рабочих дней&nbsp;— 24</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr18/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfas8p8p97/" data-dfa="dfas8p8p97"></a>Выходных&nbsp;— 7</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr19/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfasa7o3f6/" data-dfa="dfasa7o3f6"></a>Норма рабочего времени:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr20/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfasrydg51/" data-dfa="dfasrydg51"></a>При 40-часовой рабочей недели&nbsp;— 160&nbsp;ч.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr21/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfaskqp3ym/" data-dfa="dfaskqp3ym"></a>При 36-часовой рабочей недели&nbsp;— 144&nbsp;ч.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="scroller__track  scroller__track_h"><div class="scroller__bar scroller__bar_h"></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="table-wide scroller-wrapper"><div class="scroller table-scroller"><div class="scroller__container"><table width="100%"><caption></caption><tbody><tr><td style="text-align: left; vertical-align: top; width: 18.58%;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr23/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfas0clgtb/" data-dfa="dfas0clgtb"></a><strong>1&nbsp;января </strong>(четверг)</td><td style="text-align: left; vertical-align: top; width: 81.29%;"><ul class="c-list"><li><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr24/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfas94g1pg/" data-dfa="dfas94g1pg"></a>Новый год&nbsp;— нерабочий праздничный день (<a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/backlinkanchor207/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/21678/dfaseyo7mg/" class="link npd" target="_self" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="21678" anchor="dfaseyo7mg">ст.&nbsp;208&nbsp;ТК</a>)</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align: left; vertical-align: top; width: 18.58%;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr25/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfast7bo8e/" data-dfa="dfast7bo8e"></a><strong>2&nbsp;января </strong>(пятница)</td><td style="text-align: left; vertical-align: top; width: 81.29%;"><ul class="c-list"><li><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr26/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfasgqiibv/" data-dfa="dfasgqiibv"></a>дополнительный нерабочий день для всех работников, независимо от&nbsp;вида рабочей недели (п. 1&nbsp;Указа от&nbsp;24.12.2025&nbsp;№УП-<a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/backlinkanchor248/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/17673" class="link npd" target="_blank" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="17673">257</a>)</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align: left; vertical-align: top; width: 18.58%;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr27/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfascuztq6/" data-dfa="dfascuztq6"></a><strong>3 января</strong> (суббота)</td><td style="text-align: left; vertical-align: top; width: 81.29%;"><ul class="c-list"><li><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr28/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfas7zggxn/" data-dfa="dfas7zggxn"></a>дополнительный нерабочий день при шестидневной рабочей неделе (п. 1 Указа от 24.12.2025 №УП-<a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/backlinkanchor249/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/17673" class="link npd" target="_blank" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="17673">257</a>)</li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="scroller__track  scroller__track_h"><div class="scroller__bar scroller__bar_h"></div></div></div></div></div><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/tit2/" data-role="toc-anchor" class="toc-anchor"></a><h2 class="main__title-section title toc" toc-anchor="tit2"><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr29/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfaskm8ilu/" data-dfa="dfaskm8ilu"></a>ФЕВРАЛЬ</h2><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfas1bgw1z/" data-dfa="dfas1bgw1z"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr30/"></a><img alt="" hideborder="true" class="inimg" lnktype="img" id="-41915915" sourceId="1" fullSizeImageId="-41915914" width="610" height="173.69209809264305" src="https://1gb.uz/system/content/image/297/1/-41915915/"></p><div><div class="table-wide scroller-wrapper"><div class="scroller table-scroller"><div class="scroller__container"><table height="253" width="100.00%"><caption></caption><tbody><tr><td class="bdAll" style="width: 49.56%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr32/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfasm8xkur/" data-dfa="dfasm8xkur"></a><strong>Для пятидневной рабочей недели:</strong></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr33/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfas9gyuq2/" data-dfa="dfas9gyuq2"></a>Рабочих дней&nbsp;— 20</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr34/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfas5lkq8b/" data-dfa="dfas5lkq8b"></a>Выходных&nbsp;— 8</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr35/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfasquiucs/" data-dfa="dfasquiucs"></a>Норма рабочего времени:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr36/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfas71n1rk/" data-dfa="dfas71n1rk"></a>При 40-часовой рабочей недели&nbsp;— 160 ч.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr37/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfas5rou68/" data-dfa="dfas5rou68"></a>При 36-часовой рабочей недели&nbsp;— 144 ч.</p></td><td class="bdTopbdBottombdRight" style="width: 50.29%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr38/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfasq5lkbf/" data-dfa="dfasq5lkbf"></a><strong>Для шестидневной рабочей недели:</strong></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr39/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfas7mikz9/" data-dfa="dfas7mikz9"></a>Рабочих дней&nbsp;— 24</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr40/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfasewbi9r/" data-dfa="dfasewbi9r"></a>Выходных&nbsp;— 4</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr41/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfass2lmvr/" data-dfa="dfass2lmvr"></a>Норма рабочего времени:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr42/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfasu7qxog/" data-dfa="dfasu7qxog"></a>При 40-часовой рабочей недели&nbsp;— 160 ч.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr43/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfasvcwubt/" data-dfa="dfasvcwubt"></a>При 36-часовой рабочей недели&nbsp;— 144 ч.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="scroller__track  scroller__track_h"><div class="scroller__bar scroller__bar_h"></div></div></div></div></div><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/tit3/" data-role="toc-anchor" class="toc-anchor"></a><h2 class="main__title-section title toc" toc-anchor="tit3"><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr44/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfaspm8bqf/" data-dfa="dfaspm8bqf"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfasdd02ei/" data-dfa="dfasdd02ei"></a>МАРТ&nbsp;</h2><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfaskqn0s8/" data-dfa="dfaskqn0s8"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr45/"></a><img alt="" hideborder="true" class="inimg" lnktype="img" id="-41915917" sourceId="1" fullSizeImageId="-41915916" width="610" height="175.3542234332425" src="https://1gb.uz/system/content/image/297/1/-41915917/"></p><div><div class="table-wide scroller-wrapper"><div class="scroller table-scroller"><div class="scroller__container"><table width="99.60%"><caption></caption><tbody><tr><td class="bdAll" style="width: 48.74%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr47/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfaslrm3s8/" data-dfa="dfaslrm3s8"></a><strong>Для пятидневной рабочей недели:</strong></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr48/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfaspvdrsl/" data-dfa="dfaspvdrsl"></a>Рабочих дней&nbsp;— 19</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr49/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfas18vger/" data-dfa="dfas18vger"></a>Выходных&nbsp;— 12</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr50/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfasv6d47v/" data-dfa="dfasv6d47v"></a>Норма рабочего времени:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr51/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfaso3g34g/" data-dfa="dfaso3g34g"></a>При 40-часовой рабочей недели&nbsp;— 151&nbsp;ч.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr52/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfasdrsq8g/" data-dfa="dfasdrsq8g"></a>При 36-часовой рабочей недели&nbsp;— 135&nbsp;ч.</p></td><td class="bdTopbdBottombdRight" style="width: 51.13%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr53/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfasxxd3x1/" data-dfa="dfasxxd3x1"></a><strong>Для шестидневной рабочей недели:</strong></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr54/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfasuiubvo/" data-dfa="dfasuiubvo"></a>Рабочих дней&nbsp;— 23</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr55/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfaskxo386/" data-dfa="dfaskxo386"></a>Выходных&nbsp;— 8</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr56/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfas0r90px/" data-dfa="dfas0r90px"></a>Норма рабочего времени:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/bssPhr57/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/220930/dfase0n2ls/" data-dfa="dfase0n2ls"></a>При 40-часовой рабочей недели&nbsp;— 153&nbsp;ч.</p><p><a data-a